<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Socials</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>socials</a>
&lt;social&gt;
&lt;social&gt; &lt;someone&gt;
</pre>
<p>Examples:
</p>
<pre>smile
smile asta
bow
hug asta
</pre>
<p>Socials are short commands that show what you feel or do, like smile, nod, wave, 
bow, laugh or hug: there are more than two hundred. <a cmd='#'>socials</a> gives a complete 
listing of them. Most work on their own, or with the name of someone in the room 
with you: smile shows everyone that you smile, smile asta that you smile at 
Asta.
</p><p>When no social fits, write your own with <a cmd='#'>Help Emotes</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Emotes</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Commands</a>
</pre>




</div>